  "final_message": "The root cause was in [`payments.collect`](/tmp/bsvc-n9i8c_yf/billing-service/billing/payments.py:10): when a customer had no payment method, it returned without recording a failure. That left the invoice with no retry time and the subscription active.\n\nThe branch now records a `missing_payment_method` failure, which emits the event and starts dunning. I added a regression test covering retries and the final `unpaid` state, and wrote [`answer.json`](/tmp/bsvc-n9i8c_yf/billing-service/answer.json). The full suite passes: **25 tests**.",
